# Keep the build context small. Without this, Docker ships node_modules, .next,
# build output and virtualenvs to the daemon — the context ballooned past 900MB
# and every layer hash changed on unrelated edits.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/out
**/build
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/.cache

# Local env and secrets must never enter an image layer.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Virtualenvs, Python caches and tooling
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/*.egg-info

# VCS and CI
.git
.github
.gitignore

# Docs and local scratch
documentation
**/*.md
!README.md
**/*.log
.vscode
.idea

# Container and orchestration files
Dockerfile
**/Dockerfile
.dockerignore
compose*.yaml
